              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "44.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koree ilo tung'ani ng'en? Koree ilo asirani. Koree olaiguanani le na kata? Keitu eitomod Enkai eng'eno ena kop? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore ina neitu elotu enkop ayiolou Enkai te ng'eno enye, netaa ena naitiship Enkai neitajeu ninye lelo ooiruk te modai e le rorei likilikioo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
